*\n\n1. **Order.kt** — Added OrderStatus enum and status field to Order data class. Necessary for tracking order lifecycle.\n\n2. **OrderController.kt** — \n   - Updated create() to initialize new orders with OrderStatus.ACTIVE. Necessary.\n   - Added cancel() endpoint with:\n     - 404 for missing orders (ResourceNotFoundException)\n     - 200 OK for already-cancelled orders (idempotent)\n     - 409 for orders with CONFIRMED shipments (ConflictException, all-or-nothing)\n     - Cancels CREATED shipments as part of order cancellation\n   - Injected ShipmentRepository to find shipments by order. Necessary.\n\n3. **ShipmentRepository.kt** — Added findByOrderId() method to retrieve all shipments for an order. Necessary for cancel operation.\n\n4. **ShipmentController.kt** — \n   - Added check in create() to reject shipment creation for CANCELLED orders with 409 (ConflictException, ORDER_CANCELLED)\n   - Injected OrderRepository to check order status. Necessary.\n\n5. **ApiError.kt** — Added two error codes:\n   - ORDER_CANCELLED: Shipment creation rejected because order is cancelled\n   - ORDER_SHIPMENT_CONFLICT: Order cancel rejected because of confirmed shipment\n   - Necessary for error contract.\n\n6. **OrderControllerTest.kt** — Added 5 new tests covering all cancel scenarios:\n   - `cancelsActiveOrder()` — Success path\n   - `cancelCancelledOrderIsIdempotent()` — Idempotent retry\n   - `cancelOrderWithConfirmedShipmentReturns409()` — All-or-nothing conflict\n   - `cancelNonExistentOrderReturns404()` — Unknown order\n   - `cancellingAnOrderCancelsItsCreatedShipments()` — Cascading cancellation\n   - Also updated @BeforeEach to reset shipmentRepository\n\n7. **ShipmentControllerTest.kt** — Added 1 new test:\n   - `rejectsAShipmentForACancelledOrderWith409ErrorEnvelope()` — Cancelled order rejection\n   - Updated @BeforeEach to reset orderRepository\n   - Updated createShipment() helper to accept orderId parameter for flexibility\n\n**Unresolved findings:**\n\nNone. All ticket requirements have been implemented and tested.\n\n---\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement   Add POST /orders/{orderId}/cancel endpoint with order status tracking, all-or-nothing semantics for confirmed shipments, idempotency for repeated cancellations, and shipment creation rejection for cancelled orders.\n\nChanged       Order.kt — Added OrderStatus enum and status field to track order lifecycle\n              OrderController.kt — Updated create() to initialize ACTIVE status, added cancel() endpoint with all-or-nothing logic\n              ShipmentRepository.kt — Added findByOrderId() method to find shipments by order\n              ShipmentController.kt — Added validation to reject shipment creation for cancelled orders\n              ApiError.kt — Added ORDER_CANCELLED and ORDER_SHIPMENT_CONFLICT error codes\n              OrderControllerTest.kt — Added 5 tests for cancel endpoint (success, idempotency, conflict, not found, cascading shipment cancellation)\n              ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 1 test for shipment creation rejection on cancelled order\n\nTests         cancelsActiveOrder() — Verifies active order can be cancelled\n              cancelCancelledOrderIsIdempotent() — Verifies repeated cancel succeeds with no changes\n              cancelOrderWithConfirmedShipmentReturns409() — Verifies all-or-nothing: confirmed shipment blocks cancel\n              cancelNonExistentOrderReturns404() — Verifies unknown order is rejected\n              cancellingAnOrderCancelsItsCreatedShipments() — Verifies CREATED shipments are cancelled with order\n              rejectsAShipmentForACancelledOrderWith409ErrorEnvelope() — Verifies shipment creation is rejected for cancelled orders\n\nVerification  Command: ./mvnw test | Result: BUILD SUCCESS, 19 tests run (9 OrderControllerTest, 6 ShipmentControllerTest, 3 CustomerControllerTest, 1 SampleServiceApplicationTests), 0 failures\n\nNot done      (none — all ticket requirements implemented, tested, and passing)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3302,"cache_read_input_tokens":32777,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3302},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aa5d94d2-9155-4ab9-8181-60cdec7ca5bd","uuid":"50198b50-8ac9-4b71-8db6-149cb6e03f0d","timestamp":"2026-09-10T19:52:02.307Z","request_id":"req_011CevLmbUTfX2eDy9aJKneG"}
